Has a symbol lookup find nothing in an object without a symbol hash
table, as a statically linked program is, where it stopped the program
on an assertion: dlsym(RTLD_DEFAULT, ...) in a static program, as
libunwind and others do to see whether a function exists, now returns
NULL, as on musl. Meant for upstream.

